  "question": {
    "text": "If the image of the point&nbsp;<math><mi>M</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>,</mo><msup><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;on the line <math><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> is <math><mi>N</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0,2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, then the sum of the square of all the possible values of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>λ</mi></math> is equal to",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "FzX03",
      "text": "<math><mn>5</mn></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "M87f5",
      "text": "<math><mn>2</mn></math>",
